{
  "id": "fusion-popup",
  "title": "M4c popup 菜单链（窗界内菜单, OR 子窗呈现+关闭）",
  "exe": "fusion_popup.exe",
  "arch": [
    "x64"
  ],
  "build": {
    "sources": [
      "smoke/programs/win/fusion_popup.c"
    ],
    "cflags": [
      "-O2",
      "-s",
      "-Ithirdparty/wine/programs"
    ],
    "libs": [
      "-luser32",
      "-lgdi32"
    ]
  },
  "seconds": 20,
  "timeoutMs": 120000,
  "inject": true,
  "checks": [
    "result-json",
    "visual:fusion-popup-menu",
    "fusion-popup"
  ],
  "_checks_note": "M4c-T4 判定域 = popup 渲染/关闭链（已验证行为）。点选（WM_COMMAND）不注入不判 —— T3 越界点选悬案移交 M4d（checks/fusion-popup-selection 的 SKIP 口径）。"
}
